---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="about">
  <div class="about">
    <p>
      I'm a DevOps engineer at AIIT Solutions in Rawalpindi, where I run the AWS infrastructure,
      CI/CD and monitoring for HR360HUB, a multi-service Laravel SaaS.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that I interned at Al Nafi, working with AWS, Terraform, Kubernetes on EKS, Prometheus
      and Grafana, and at Cloudlem on CI/CD reliability.
    </p>
    <p>
      In October 2025 I completed the EduQual Level 6 Diploma in Artificial Intelligence Operations
      with a Distinction (88%).
    </p>
    <p class="now">
      Currently applying for Master's programmes in Europe for 2027 and open to remote DevOps roles.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .now {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }
</style>
